      "widgets_values": [
        "Image to tags\n\n1. Drag any image onto Load Image (or click it to pick a file).\n2. Press Run. The tags appear in the tagger node after a few seconds.\n3. Copy the tags you want into your generation prompt.\n\nthreshold: lower (0.25) gives more tags, higher (0.5) only the confident ones.\ncharacter_threshold: how sure it must be before naming a character.\n\nParentheses in character tags are escaped automatically (ulrich von hutten \\(azur lane\\)), so the output can be pasted straight into a prompt.\n\nexclude_tags: comma-separated tags to leave out, for example the source character when you only want the pose and lighting.\n\nThe tagger runs on the CPU, so it does not use VRAM."
